Change to Snackbar message property to allow for any string rather than a translation key

**New**
```jsx
export const Snackbar = () => {
  const classes = useStyles();
  const { alert } = useSnackbar();

  return (
    <div className={classes.root}>
      {alert ? <Alert severity={alert.type}>{alert.message}</Alert> : null}
    </div>
  );
};
```

* Now requires user preferences and book list
* Currently recommends a single book (can update in a later PR to return books whose scores are above a given threshold)
* Input requests must be POST requests with a body of the form (expressed as a TypeScript interface):
```typescript
interface Book {
  books: {
    isbn?: string;
    title: string;
    author?: string;
    year?: number;
    publisher?: string;
}
```

